// Deploy the FastAPI service (see yaps-backend/README.md) and put its URL here.
// Real-AI chat server (yaps-ai-server/). Paste its address here, e.g. 'https://yaps-ai.onrender.com'. Leave '' to keep the built-in YAPS AI only.
const YAPS_AI_URL = '';
