k('artists?|discover','Artists lets you browse and discover performers, then open their tracks. Say “tell me about” and an artist name and I will pull up their songs.',['Artists','p:artists']);
k('genres?|search|find (a )?(song|music)','Search and Genres let you look up songs and artists or browse by genre. You can also just ask me, for example “songs like Yoyo”.',['Search &amp; Genres','p:search']);
k('quick ?vibes?|moods?','Quick Vibes are ready playlists for the moment: Chill, Hype, Heartbreak, Kampala, Gospel, Party, Workout, Love and Late Night.',['Quick Vibes','p:quickvibes']);
