k('speed|crossfade|equali[sz]er|audio quality|playback','Playback speed cycles from the player button. Crossfade (0 to 12 seconds), audio quality and other sound options are in Settings, Playback.',['Playback settings','s:playback'],['Change speed','f:speed']);
