k('themes?|dark mode|light mode|appearance|colou?rs?','Dark and Light mode and the colour themes (Neon, Ocean, Crimson, Emerald, Violet, Aurora) are in Settings, Appearance. Some themes may need Premium.',['Appearance','s:appearance']);
