k('privacy|private account|block|delete (my )?account|security|password','Privacy &amp; Security lets you make your account private, choose who can follow or message you, hide listening activity, manage blocked users, reset your password or delete your account.',['Privacy settings','s:privacy'],['Privacy Policy','f:privacy']);
